      "name": "NftBinding",
      "docs": [
        "NftBinding represents an NFT bound to a specific stream.",
        "On Solana, NFTs are SPL tokens with supply=1 and decimals=0.",
        "Ownership is determined by checking which Token Account holds the NFT.",
        "",
        "PDA seeds: [NftBinding::SEED, stream_id]",
        "This creates a 1:1 relationship between Stream and NftBinding.",
        "The stream_id binding is guaranteed by PDA derivation - no need to store it.",
        "Once initialized, the binding is immutable."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
